1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:00,800
When did

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:01,360
the favorites

3
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,160
button arrive?

4
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:02,880
Your project

5
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:03,440
has weeks

6
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,240
of changes.

7
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:04,920
Git log

8
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:05,360
gives you

9
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:05,760
a history

10
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,240
overview,

11
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:06,560
so you

12
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:06,880
can find

13
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:07,920
the commit connected

14
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:08,680
to that feature.

15
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:10,560
Think of

16
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,280
each entry

17
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,480
as a signpost,

18
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,000
a commit identity,

19
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:14,880
an author,

20
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,520
a date,

21
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,560
and a message.

22
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:17,760
Those messages help

23
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:18,320
you scan

24
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:18,800
the story

25
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,360
and choose

26
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,680
where to investigate.

27
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,040
A graph adds

28
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,480
the family connections.

29
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,080
Lines link commits to

30
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:26,880
their parents,

31
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,240
showing where development

32
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,600
split and joined.

33
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,240
The gaps

34
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:30,640
are not

35
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,360
a clock,

36
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,560
and separate lanes

37
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:33,040
are not

38
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,760
an execution schedule.

39
00:00:35,986 --> 00:00:36,866
By default,

40
00:00:36,866 --> 00:00:37,906
the history starts

41
00:00:37,906 --> 00:00:38,226
from your

42
00:00:38,226 --> 00:00:39,266
current commit and

43
00:00:39,266 --> 00:00:40,866
follows its ancestors.

44
00:00:40,866 --> 00:00:42,226
A separate unmerged

45
00:00:42,226 --> 00:00:42,786
branch is

46
00:00:42,786 --> 00:00:44,226
not automatically included.

47
00:00:44,226 --> 00:00:45,266
Use the overview

48
00:00:45,266 --> 00:00:45,586
to find

49
00:00:45,586 --> 00:00:46,306
your place,

50
00:00:46,306 --> 00:00:47,026
then inspect

51
00:00:47,026 --> 00:00:48,266
the relevant commit.
